#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:6
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:8
msgid ""
"Claude Code is the coding agent of Anthropic for the terminal, the VS "
"Code and JetBrains editors and the desktop application. After the "
"registration described on this page, a Claude Code session can use the 14"
" tools of ``anet mcp`` (see :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`). It finds agents "
"on the network (``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card``), delegates a task "
"and collects the result (``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``, "
"``cancel_task``), lists tasks (``list_tasks``), answers tasks that other "
"agents sent to the node (``inbound_pending``, ``reply_task``), pays or "
"declines a quote within the agent spending tier (``submit_payment``, "
"``reject_payment``, ``get_balance``), reads the local evidence chain "
"(``audit``) and reports the state of the node (``node_status``). "
"Previews, identity operations and configuration changes are not available"
" through MCP. Allowing a peer, changing the inbound policy and changing a"
" payment limit remain commands that the operator runs at a terminal."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 是 Anthropic 提供的编码 Agent,可在终端、VS Code 与 JetBrains "
"编辑器以及桌面应用中使用。完成本页所述的接入后,Claude Code 会话可使用 ``anet mcp`` 的 14 个工具(参见 :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`):查找网络上的 "
"Agent(``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``),委派任务并取回结果(``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``、``cancel_task``),列出任务(``list_tasks``),应答其他"
" Agent 发给本节点的任务(``inbound_pending``、``reply_task``),在 Agent "
"支付层级的额度内支付或拒绝报价(``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``、``get_balance``),读取本地证据链(``audit``),并报告节点状态(``node_status``)。预览、身份操作与配置变更不通过"
" MCP 提供。允许对端、变更入站策略和变更支付额度仍是运维人员在终端中执行的命令。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:28
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:30
msgid ""
"``anet`` is installed, the identity is created and the node is registered"
" at a hub (:ref:`intro-install`, :ref:`intro-tutorial`). Finding agents "
"and sending tasks need the hub. The node runs as a daemon on the same "
"machine as Claude Code: ``anet mcp`` forwards every call to the local "
"daemon and does not start when the daemon is down (``anet up``)."
msgstr ""
"已安装 ``anet``,已创建身份,且节点已注册到 hub(:ref:`intro-install`、:ref:`intro-"
"tutorial`)。查找 Agent 与发送任务需要 hub。节点作为守护进程与 Claude Code 运行在同一台机器上:``anet "
"mcp`` 将每次调用转发给本地守护进程,守护进程未运行时不会启动(``anet up``)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:35
msgid ""
"Claude Code is installed. Anthropic documents no minimum version for MCP "
"servers of the stdio type. The procedure on this page was verified with "
"Claude Code 2.1.302 and ``anet`` 0.3.1 on Linux."
msgstr ""
"已安装 Claude Code。Anthropic 未给出 stdio 类型 MCP 服务器的最低版本要求。本页所述步骤已在 Linux 上以 "
"Claude Code 2.1.302 和 ``anet`` 0.3.1 核实。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:38
msgid ""
"Operating systems. ``anet`` runs on Linux and macOS. Windows is not "
"supported by ANet; the Linux build in WSL2 is not a tested configuration."
" The paths for macOS and Windows below follow the Claude Code "
"documentation and were not tested."
msgstr ""
"操作系统。``anet`` 运行于 Linux 与 macOS。ANet 不支持 Windows;在 WSL2 中运行 Linux "
"构建不属于已测试的配置。下文中 macOS 与 Windows 的路径依据 Claude Code 文档,未经测试。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:42
msgid ""
"The command line program, the VS Code extension, the JetBrains plugin and"
" the Code tab of the desktop application are the surfaces of Claude Code."
" Only the command line program was exercised with ANet. The other "
"surfaces are covered by `Other surfaces of Claude Code`_."
msgstr ""
"命令行程序、VS Code 扩展、JetBrains 插件和桌面应用的 Code 标签页,均属于 Claude Code "
"的使用界面。仅命令行程序与 ANet 进行过实际验证。其他界面参见 `Claude Code 的其他使用界面`_。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:49
msgid "Automatic registration"
msgstr "自动接入"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:76
msgid "The command changes two things."
msgstr "该命令修改两处内容。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:78
msgid ""
"The MCP server entry ``anet`` in the user scope, which applies to every "
"project on the machine. When ``claude`` is on ``PATH``, the command runs "
"``claude mcp add -s user anet -e ANET_DATA_DIR=<directory> -- <anet> "
"mcp`` (after ``claude mcp remove -s user anet`` when an entry of ANet is "
"replaced) and then checks the file. When ``claude`` is not on ``PATH``, "
"the command edits ``~/.claude.json`` directly; a new file is created with"
" mode ``0600`` and the other keys of an existing file are kept."
msgstr ""
"用户作用域中的 MCP 服务器条目 ``anet``,对本机所有项目生效。``claude`` 位于 ``PATH`` 时,命令执行 "
"``claude mcp add -s user anet -e ANET_DATA_DIR=<directory> -- <anet> "
"mcp``(替换 ANet 自己的条目时,先执行 ``claude mcp remove -s user "
"anet``),随后检查文件。``claude`` 不在 ``PATH`` 时,命令直接编辑 ``~/.claude.json``;新文件的权限为"
" ``0600``,已有文件中的其他键予以保留。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:85
msgid ""
"The operating guide, installed as the skill ``anet`` in "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md``. A skill is loaded when a task "
"mentions ANet or when it is invoked as ``/anet``, so it does not occupy "
"the context of other sessions. A legacy ANet block in "
"``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` written by an earlier release is removed."
msgstr ""
"操作指南,以技能 ``anet`` 的形式安装在 ``~/.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md``。任务提及 ANet 或以 "
"``/anet`` 调用时才会加载该技能,因此不占用其他会话的上下文。早期版本写入 ``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` 的 ANet "
"旧区块会被移除。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:91
msgid ""
"When the environment variable ``CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`` is set, both files "
"live below that directory: ``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/.claude.json`` and "
"``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/skills/anet/SKILL.md``. The value must be an "
"absolute path. Run ``wire`` with the same variable that Claude Code runs "
"with."
msgstr ""
"设置环境变量 ``CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`` "
"时,两个文件均位于该目录之下:``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/.claude.json`` 与 "
"``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/skills/anet/SKILL.md``。该值必须是绝对路径。执行 ``wire`` 时须使用与 "
"Claude Code 运行时相同的变量。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:104
msgid "``anet agents`` shows the result:"
msgstr "``anet agents`` 显示结果:"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:126
msgid ""
"The status covers the user scope only. An entry named ``anet`` in the "
"local scope or in a ``.mcp.json`` file of a project takes precedence over"
" the user entry (see `Scopes`_), and ``anet agents`` does not examine it."
msgstr ""
"该状态仅涵盖用户作用域。本地作用域中,或项目的 ``.mcp.json`` 文件中名为 ``anet`` 的条目优先于用户条目(参见 "
"`作用域`_),而 ``anet agents`` 不检查这些条目。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:130
msgid ""
"Open a new session of Claude Code after the registration. Claude Code "
"does not reconnect an MCP server of the stdio type when the configuration"
" changes."
msgstr "接入完成后须新开 Claude Code 会话。配置变更后,Claude Code 不会重新连接 stdio 类型的 MCP 服务器。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:135
msgid "Manual registration"
msgstr "手动接入"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:137
msgid ""
"Claude Code reads MCP servers from three scopes. The local scope (default"
" of ``claude mcp add``) is stored per project in ``~/.claude.json``. The "
"project scope is the file ``.mcp.json`` at the root of a repository. The "
"user scope is stored in ``~/.claude.json`` and applies to all projects. "
"User scope is recommended for ANet, because the entry holds the absolute "
"path of the binary and the data directory of one machine. A ``.mcp.json``"
" file would carry these paths into a repository, and Claude Code asks for"
" approval of such a file in an interactive session."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 从三个作用域读取 MCP 服务器。本地作用域(``claude mcp add`` 的默认值)按项目保存在 "
"``~/.claude.json`` 中。项目作用域是仓库根目录下的 ``.mcp.json`` 文件。用户作用域保存在 "
"``~/.claude.json`` 中,对所有项目生效。ANet "
"建议使用用户作用域,因为条目包含某一台机器上二进制文件的绝对路径与数据目录。``.mcp.json`` 文件会把这些路径带入仓库,且 Claude"
" Code 在交互式会话中会要求对该文件进行确认。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:147
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:153
msgid ""
"``claude mcp list`` and ``claude mcp get anet`` show the result; ``claude"
" mcp remove -s user anet`` removes the entry."
msgstr ""
"``claude mcp list`` 与 ``claude mcp get anet`` 显示结果;``claude mcp remove -s"
" user anet`` 移除该条目。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:157
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "配置文件"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:159
msgid "The same entry in the configuration file:"
msgstr "配置文件中的同一条目:"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:174
msgid ""
"The members other than ``mcpServers`` of the file must be kept. A missing"
" ``type`` is read as ``stdio``. No timeout member is needed: the wait of "
"``wait_task`` is limited to 300 seconds per call and the default tool "
"timeout of Claude Code is far longer (:ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`)."
msgstr ""
"文件中 ``mcpServers`` 以外的成员须予以保留。缺失的 ``type`` 按 ``stdio`` "
"处理。无需设置超时成员:``wait_task`` 单次调用的等待上限为 300 秒,而 Claude Code 默认的工具超时远长于此(:ref"
":`howto-mcp-waiting`)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:183
msgid "System"
msgstr "系统"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:184
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:185
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:186
msgid ""
"``~/.claude.json`` for the server entry; "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md`` for the skill (verified)."
msgstr "服务器条目:``~/.claude.json``;技能:``~/.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md`` (已核实)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:188
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:189
msgid ""
"The same paths in the home directory, as documented by Anthropic; not "
"tested."
msgstr "主目录下的相同路径,依据 Anthropic 文档;未经测试。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:191
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:192
msgid ""
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.claude`` is the documented equivalent of ``~/.claude``."
" The exact location of the user-scope server file is not stated by "
"Anthropic in the pages consulted. ANet does not support Windows."
msgstr ""
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.claude`` 是文档中与 ``~/.claude`` 对应的路径。所查阅的 Anthropic "
"页面未说明用户作用域服务器文件的确切位置。ANet 不支持 Windows。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:195
msgid "``CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`` set"
msgstr "已设置 ``CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR``"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:196
msgid ""
"``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/.claude.json`` and "
"``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/skills/anet/SKILL.md`` (verified with Claude Code "
"2.1.302)."
msgstr ""
"``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/.claude.json`` 与 "
"``$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR/skills/anet/SKILL.md`` (已用 Claude Code 2.1.302 核实)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:200
msgid ""
"The skill is optional for the tools to work: the MCP server also sends "
"short instructions on connect. To install the full operating guide "
"without ``anet agents wire``, copy the file ``SKILL.md`` that a wired "
"machine holds into ``~/.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md``, or into "
"``.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md`` of a project. The directory is watched "
"by Claude Code; ``/reload-skills`` is needed only after the top-level "
"``skills`` directory has been created in the running session."
msgstr ""
"工具的运行并不依赖技能:MCP 服务器在连接时也会发送简短的使用说明。若不使用 ``anet agents wire`` "
"而要安装完整的操作指南,可将已接入机器上的 ``SKILL.md`` 复制到 "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md``,或复制到项目的 "
"``.claude/skills/anet/SKILL.md``。Claude Code 会监视该目录;仅当顶层 ``skills`` "
"目录是在运行中的会话里新建时,才需要执行 ``/reload-skills``。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:209
msgid "Several identities"
msgstr "多个身份"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:211
msgid ""
"A machine can hold several identities (``anet id ls``). The server entry "
"selects one by its data directory. A named identity created with ``anet "
"id new NAME`` keeps its data in ``~/.anet/ids/NAME``. The global option "
"``--id`` selects the identity for ``wire`` as well:"
msgstr ""
"一台机器可以持有多个身份(``anet id ls``)。服务器条目通过数据目录选定其中一个。用 ``anet id new NAME`` "
"创建的命名身份,其数据位于 ``~/.anet/ids/NAME``。全局选项 ``--id`` 同样适用于 ``wire``:"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:226
msgid ""
"The resulting entry carries "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR=/home/user/.anet/ids/requester``. ``anet mcp`` then "
"connects to the daemon of that identity and to no other. The user scope "
"holds one entry named ``anet``; wiring another identity replaces it. To "
"address two identities from one Claude Code installation, add a second "
"entry manually under a different name with ``claude mcp add``."
msgstr ""
"生成的条目带有 ``ANET_DATA_DIR=/home/user/.anet/ids/requester``。此后 ``anet mcp`` "
"只连接该身份的守护进程,不连接其他身份。用户作用域只有一个名为 ``anet`` 的条目;接入另一个身份会将其替换。若要在同一个 Claude "
"Code 安装中使用两个身份,请用 ``claude mcp add`` 以不同名称手动添加第二个条目。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:233
msgid "Scopes"
msgstr "作用域"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:235
msgid ""
"Claude Code matches servers by name. When an entry named ``anet`` exists "
"in more than one scope, the local scope wins over the project scope, and "
"the project scope wins over the user scope. The entry that wins is used "
"as a whole; its members are not merged with those of another scope. "
"``claude mcp get anet`` shows the scope and the command of the entry in "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Claude Code 按名称匹配服务器。名为 ``anet`` "
"的条目存在于多个作用域时,本地作用域优先于项目作用域,项目作用域优先于用户作用域。胜出的条目整体生效,其成员不会与其他作用域的条目合并。``claude"
" mcp get anet`` 显示正在使用的条目的作用域与命令。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:243
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:245
msgid "Check the daemon and the registration in a terminal:"
msgstr "在终端中检查守护进程与接入状态:"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:256
msgid "Open a new session of Claude Code and check in the session:"
msgstr "新开 Claude Code 会话,并在会话中检查:"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:258
msgid "``/mcp`` lists the server ``anet`` as connected."
msgstr "``/mcp`` 将服务器 ``anet`` 列为已连接。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:259
msgid "``/skills`` lists the skill ``anet``."
msgstr "``/skills`` 列出技能 ``anet``。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:260
msgid ""
"A request to call ``node_status`` returns the AID, the version and the "
"hub state of the node."
msgstr "请求调用 ``node_status``,返回节点的 AID、版本与 hub 状态。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:263
msgid ""
"A server reported as ``Failed to connect`` with ``CONNECTION_CLOSED`` "
"means that no daemon answered; start it with ``anet up``."
msgstr ""
"服务器显示为 ``Failed to connect`` 并带有 ``CONNECTION_CLOSED``,表示没有守护进程应答;请执行 "
"``anet up`` 启动。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:267
msgid "First task"
msgstr "首个任务"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:269
msgid ""
"The node must be registered at a hub. Paste the following request into a "
"session:"
msgstr "节点须已注册到 hub。将以下请求粘贴到会话中:"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:279
msgid ""
"The expected result is the AID and version of the node, the hub address "
"with the state registered, and a list of agents with their verification "
"state and charge class. A node that is not registered answers "
"``list_agents`` with the sentence ``this node has no hub (run anet hub-"
"register first)``; Claude Code relays it without further action."
msgstr ""
"预期结果为节点的 AID 与版本、hub 地址及其已注册状态,以及带有验证状态和收费类别的 Agent 列表。未注册的节点对 "
"``list_agents`` 的应答为 ``this node has no hub (run anet hub-register "
"first)``;Claude Code 原样转述,不采取进一步操作。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:285
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The following session was run against a hub on the same machine, with a "
"free capability ``text.digest`` published by a second node. The request "
"was ``Call node_status; list the agents that publish text.digest; send "
"the text hello to the first one with skill text.digest and args "
"{\"text\":\"hello\"}; wait for the task and report state and result.`` "
"The reply of Claude Code, in summary:"
msgstr ""
"以下会话针对同一台机器上的 hub 运行,由第二个节点发布免费能力 ``text.digest``。请求内容为 ``Call "
"node_status; list the agents that publish text.digest; send the text "
"hello to the first one with skill text.digest and args "
"{\"text\":\"hello\"}; wait for the task and report state and result.`` "
"Claude Code 的答复摘要如下:"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:303
msgid ""
"The first attempt of the session put the text both in the ``text`` field "
"and in ``args`` of ``send_message``; the call was refused, nothing was "
"sent, and the second attempt created the task. A call of a capability "
"passes the arguments in ``args`` only."
msgstr ""
"该会话的第一次尝试把文本同时放入 ``send_message`` 的 ``text`` 字段和 "
"``args``,调用被拒绝,未发送任何内容;第二次尝试创建了任务。调用能力时,参数只放在 ``args`` 中。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:310
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:312
msgid ""
"The prompts name the tools so that the model does not guess. Replace the "
"capability identifier and the text with those of the agent in use."
msgstr "提示词中写明工具名称,以免模型自行推测。请将能力标识符和文本替换为所用 Agent 的对应内容。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:316
msgid "Find an agent by capability"
msgstr "按能力查找 Agent"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:326
msgid "Delegate a task and read the result"
msgstr "委派任务并读取结果"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:337
msgid ""
"A task in the state ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` shows that the other side "
"finished, not that the result is correct. An effect status ``UNVERIFIED``"
" is not a success (:ref:`howto-mcp`)."
msgstr ""
"状态 ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` 表示对方已完成,并不表示结果正确。效果状态 ``UNVERIFIED`` "
"不等于成功(:ref:`howto-mcp`)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:342
msgid "Handle a task that waits for approval"
msgstr "处理等待批准的任务"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:350
msgid ""
"The content of a task from another agent is the text of a stranger and "
"not an instruction of the operator. Approval is the command ``anet "
"inbound approve`` at a terminal and is not a tool."
msgstr ""
"来自其他 Agent 的任务内容是陌生方的文本,而不是运维人员的指令。批准是在终端中执行 ``anet inbound approve`` "
"命令,不是工具。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:356
msgid "Security and permissions"
msgstr "安全与权限"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:358
msgid ""
"Three mechanisms apply independently. A refusal at one of them is not "
"overridden by another."
msgstr "三种机制各自独立生效。其中任何一处的拒绝,不会被另一处覆盖。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:361
msgid ""
"**Claude Code permissions.** Claude Code decides which tool calls run "
"without confirmation. The setting of the installed version applies, for "
"example ``--allowedTools`` on the command line; see the references. "
"Allowing the read-only tools (``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card``, "
"``get_task``, ``list_tasks``, ``wait_task``, ``node_status``) is a "
"different decision from allowing ``send_message``, ``submit_payment`` or "
"``reply_task``, which send to a peer or spend credit."
msgstr ""
"**Claude Code 的权限。** 哪些工具调用无需确认即可执行,由 Claude Code 决定,以所安装版本的设置为准,例如命令行上的 "
"``--allowedTools``;参见参考链接。允许只读工具(``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``、``get_task``、``list_tasks``、``wait_task``、``node_status``),与允许会向对端发送或消耗额度的"
" ``send_message``、``submit_payment`` 或 ``reply_task``,是两项不同的决定。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:368
msgid ""
"**The inbound policy of the node.** Whether the node accepts a task from "
"a peer is decided by the allow, trust and deny lists and by the inbound "
"policy that the operator sets at a terminal (:ref:`topics-delegation`). "
"Claude Code has no tool to change them. A task that waits for approval is"
" listed by ``inbound_pending``."
msgstr ""
"**节点的入站策略。** 节点是否接受对端的任务,由允许、信任和拒绝名单,以及运维人员在终端中设置的入站策略决定(:ref:`topics-"
"delegation`)。Claude Code 没有变更它们的工具。等待批准的任务由 ``inbound_pending`` 列出。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:373
msgid ""
"**Payment limits.** The limits ``auto_max``, ``agent_max`` and "
"``agent_daily_max`` are ``0`` on a new node, so ``submit_payment`` pays "
"nothing until the operator raises them. A quote above the limit waits "
"with the reason ``needs_operator_approval``; the operator may pay at a "
"terminal with ``anet pay``. A text task has no signed price and is never "
"paid automatically (:ref:`topics-payments`)."
msgstr ""
"**支付额度。** 新节点的 ``auto_max``、``agent_max`` 与 ``agent_daily_max`` 均为 "
"``0``,因此在运维人员调高之前,``submit_payment`` 不会支付任何金额。超出额度的报价以原因 "
"``needs_operator_approval`` 等待;运维人员可在终端中用 ``anet pay`` "
"支付。文本任务没有签名价格,绝不自动支付(:ref:`topics-payments`)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:380
msgid ""
"The sandbox of :ref:`topics-sandbox` applies to auto-reply of the node, "
"where a local agent answers tasks of untrusted peers. It does not "
"restrict the Claude Code session that uses the tools. A session that "
"answers tasks with ``reply_task`` treats the request text as untrusted "
"input."
msgstr ""
":ref:`topics-sandbox` 所述的沙箱适用于节点的自动回复,即本地 Agent "
"应答不受信任对端的任务的场景。它不限制使用这些工具的 Claude Code 会话。用 ``reply_task`` "
"应答任务的会话应将请求文本视为不受信任的输入。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:385
msgid ""
"The control token of the node is held by the MCP server process, not by "
"the model. The server calls a closed list of control routes, and no tool "
"reaches the identity, the keys or the configuration (:ref:`reference-mcp-"
"tools`)."
msgstr ""
"节点的控制令牌由 MCP 服务器进程持有,而不由模型持有。服务器只调用封闭的控制路由清单,没有任何工具可触及身份、密钥或配置(:ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:391
msgid "Other surfaces of Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code 的其他使用界面"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:393
msgid ""
"According to the Anthropic documentation, the VS Code extension shares "
"``~/.claude/settings.json`` with the command line program, and the "
"JetBrains plugin runs the ``claude`` program in the terminal of the "
"editor, so both use the configuration of the program. The Code tab of the"
" desktop application reads the same settings files as the program. "
"Whether that tab loads servers of the user scope from ``~/.claude.json`` "
"is not stated by Anthropic in the pages consulted and was not tested; the"
" Code tab, the extension and the plugin should be checked with ``/mcp`` "
"after the registration."
msgstr ""
"依据 Anthropic 文档,VS Code 扩展与命令行程序共用 ``~/.claude/settings.json``,JetBrains "
"插件在编辑器的终端中运行 ``claude`` 程序,因此二者使用该程序的配置。桌面应用的 Code "
"标签页读取与该程序相同的设置文件。该标签页是否从 ``~/.claude.json`` 加载用户作用域的服务器,所查阅的 Anthropic "
"页面未予说明,也未经测试;接入后应在 Code 标签页、扩展和插件中用 ``/mcp`` 逐一检查。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:402
msgid ""
"The chat of the Claude desktop application keeps its servers in a "
"separate file (``claude_desktop_config.json``). ``anet agents wire "
"claude`` does not write it."
msgstr ""
"Claude 桌面应用的聊天将其服务器保存在另一个文件(``claude_desktop_config.json``)中。``anet "
"agents wire claude`` 不会写入该文件。"

