#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:418
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` refuses to start because no daemon answers for the data "
"directory of the entry."
msgstr "该条目所指数据目录没有守护进程应答,``anet mcp`` 拒绝启动。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:420
msgid ""
"Run ``anet up`` (``anet up NAME`` for a named identity), then open a new "
"session."
msgstr "执行 ``anet up``(命名身份用 ``anet up NAME``),然后新开会话。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:422
msgid "The tools are missing after ``wire``"
msgstr "执行 ``wire`` 后工具缺失"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:423
msgid ""
"Claude Code reads the configuration at the start of a session and does "
"not reconnect servers of the stdio type."
msgstr "Claude Code 在会话开始时读取配置,不会重新连接 stdio 类型的服务器。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:425
msgid "Open a new session or restart Claude Code."
msgstr "新开会话或重启 Claude Code。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:427
msgid ""
"An entry named ``anet`` in the local scope or in a project ``.mcp.json`` "
"takes precedence over the user entry."
msgstr "本地作用域或项目 ``.mcp.json`` 中名为 ``anet`` 的条目优先于用户条目。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:429
msgid "Run ``claude mcp get anet``, remove or rename the entry that wins."
msgstr "执行 ``claude mcp get anet``,移除或改名胜出的条目。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:431
msgid "A server named ``anet`` exists that ANet did not write."
msgstr "已存在名为 ``anet`` 但非 ANet 所写的服务器。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:432
msgid ""
"Rename or remove that entry with ``claude mcp remove``, then run ``wire``"
" again."
msgstr "用 ``claude mcp remove`` 改名或移除该条目,然后重新执行 ``wire``。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:434
msgid "``this node has no hub (run anet hub-register first)``"
msgstr "``this node has no hub (run anet hub-register first)``"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:435
msgid "The node is not registered at a hub."
msgstr "节点尚未注册到 hub。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:436
msgid ""
"Run ``anet hub-register <hub URL>`` (:ref:`intro-tutorial`). Relay the "
"sentence; do not register again from the session."
msgstr ""
"执行 ``anet hub-register <hub URL>`` (:ref:`intro-"
"tutorial`)。原样转述该语句,不要在会话中重复注册。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:438
msgid "``wire`` reports a temporary ``go run`` build"
msgstr "``wire`` 报告这是临时的 ``go run`` 构建"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:439
msgid "The binary path would not outlive the command."
msgstr "该二进制文件的路径在命令结束后即失效。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:440
msgid "Run ``wire`` from an installed binary (:ref:`intro-install`)."
msgstr "从已安装的二进制文件执行 ``wire`` (:ref:`intro-install`)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:441
msgid "Configuration is written to an unexpected place"
msgstr "配置被写到意料之外的位置"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:442
msgid "``CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`` redirects both files."
msgstr "``CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`` 重定向了两个文件的位置。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:443
msgid ""
"Print the variable. Run ``wire`` with the same value that Claude Code "
"runs with."
msgstr "输出该变量的值。执行 ``wire`` 时使用与 Claude Code 运行时相同的值。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:445
msgid "A task is still ``working`` after ``wait_task``"
msgstr "执行 ``wait_task`` 后任务仍为 ``working``"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:446
msgid ""
"The wait ended; ``wait_task`` waits 30 seconds by default and at most 300"
" seconds per call."
msgstr "等待已结束;``wait_task`` 默认等待 30 秒,单次调用最长 300 秒。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:448
msgid ""
"Call ``wait_task`` again. Do not send the task again: a second send is a "
"second task."
msgstr "再次调用 ``wait_task``。不要重新发送任务:再次发送即产生第二个任务。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:450
msgid "A result ends with a notice of its size"
msgstr "结果以篇幅提示结尾"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:451
msgid "A tool result is cut to about 24 KB."
msgstr "工具结果被截断至约 24 KB。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:452
msgid "Read the whole task in a terminal: ``anet task get <task-id> --full``."
msgstr "在终端中读取完整任务:``anet task get <task-id> --full``。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:453
msgid "``submit_payment`` answers ``needs_operator_approval``"
msgstr "``submit_payment`` 返回 ``needs_operator_approval``"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:454
msgid "The price is above the limits of the agent tier."
msgstr "价格超出 Agent 层级的额度。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:455
msgid ""
"Report price and payee to the operator, who decides and may pay with "
"``anet pay <task-id>`` (:ref:`topics-payments`)."
msgstr "向运维人员报告价格与收款方,由其决定,并可用 ``anet pay <task-id>`` 支付(:ref:`topics-payments`)。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:458
msgid ""
"The diagnosis commands and the reason codes are described in :ref:`howto-"
"troubleshooting` and :ref:`reference-reason-codes`. ``anet doctor`` "
"reports the state of the registration in the line ``agents.claude``."
msgstr ""
"诊断命令与原因码见 :ref:`howto-troubleshooting` 与 :ref:`reference-reason-"
"codes`。``anet doctor`` 在 ``agents.claude`` 一行报告接入状态。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:464
msgid "Disconnecting"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:479
msgid ""
"To disconnect by hand, run ``claude mcp remove -s user anet``, or delete "
"the member ``mcpServers.anet`` from ``~/.claude.json``, and delete the "
"directory ``~/.claude/skills/anet``. Open a new session afterwards. The "
"node, its identity and its data are not changed by either method."
msgstr ""
"手动断开时,执行 ``claude mcp remove -s user anet``,或从 ``~/.claude.json`` 中删除成员 "
"``mcpServers.anet``,并删除目录 "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet``。之后新开会话。两种方式都不会改变节点、其身份及其数据。"

