#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:53
msgid ""
"``claude-code`` is accepted as an alias of ``claude``. The command works "
"on files only and needs no running daemon. The output is in English by "
"default and in Chinese when ``ANET_LANG`` is ``zh-CN``. The following "
"output was produced by ``anet`` 0.3.3 on Linux with a temporary home "
"directory; the first line names the binary and the data directory in use:"
msgstr ""
"``claude-code`` 是 ``claude`` "
"的别名。该命令只操作文件，不需要守护进程正在运行。其输出默认为英文，``ANET_LANG`` 为 ``zh-CN`` 时为中文。以下输出由 "
"``anet`` 0.3.3 在 Linux 上使用临时主目录生成；第一行列出所用的二进制文件与数据目录："

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:69
msgid ""
"The status words are ``written``, ``up to date``, ``not installed, "
"skipped``, ``conflict``, ``removed``, ``not wired`` and ``failed``. The "
"last two lines state that the tool must be restarted or a new session "
"opened, that ``anet mcp`` needs the local daemon, and how the change is "
"undone. A refusal is printed with its reason code in square brackets, for"
" example ``[wire_conflict]``, and the next step follows on a line that "
"begins with an arrow when the code has a command; the codes are listed in"
" :ref:`reason-codes-w`."
msgstr ""
"状态词为 ``written``、``up to date``、``not installed, "
"skipped``、``conflict``、``removed``、``not wired`` 与 ``failed``\\ "
"（``ANET_LANG`` 为 ``zh-CN`` 时分别为 "
"``已写入``、``已是最新``、``未安装，已跳过``、``冲突``、``已移除``、``未接入`` 与 "
"``失败``）。最后两行说明：须重启该工具或新开会话；``anet mcp`` "
"需要本机守护进程；以及如何撤销本次变更。拒绝信息的末尾以方括号给出原因代码，例如 "
"``[wire_conflict]``；该代码带有命令时，下一步另起一行，以箭头开头；代码列于 :ref:`reason-codes-w`。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:98
msgid ""
"The entry names the ``anet`` binary by its absolute path and sets "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``. Writes are atomic and keep the file mode. Every file "
"that is changed is backed up first, as ``<file>.anet-bak-<UTC time>``, "
"and the backup is printed. Wiring twice changes nothing and reports ``up "
"to date``. An entry named ``anet`` that ANet did not write is reported as"
" ``conflict``; the command then exits with status 1 and changes nothing. "
"A binary started by ``go run`` is refused, because its path does not "
"outlive the command."
msgstr ""
"条目以绝对路径指明 ``anet`` 二进制文件，并设置 "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``。写入是原子的，并保持文件权限。凡被修改的文件均先备份，备份名为 ``<file>.anet-bak-<UTC "
"time>``，并在输出中列出。重复接入不产生任何变更，并报告 ``up to date``。名为 ``anet`` 但非 ANet "
"所写的条目报告为 ``conflict``；此时命令以状态码 1 退出，且不做任何修改。由 ``go run`` "
"启动的二进制文件会被拒绝，因为其路径在命令结束后即失效。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:119
msgid ""
"``wired, up to date`` means wired and current; ``not installed`` means "
"that the tool was not detected. ``claude`` counts as present when the "
"program is on ``PATH`` or when ``~/.claude`` or ``~/.claude.json`` "
"exists. Without a tool name, ``anet agents wire`` registers every tool "
"that is present. The command does not write the configuration of the "
"desktop chat application (``claude_desktop_config.json``), of VS Code or "
"of a project."
msgstr ""
"``wired, up to date`` 表示已接入且为最新；``not installed`` 表示未检测到该工具。程序位于 "
"``PATH``，或 ``~/.claude`` 或 ``~/.claude.json`` 存在时，``claude`` "
"视为存在。不指定工具名时，``anet agents wire`` "
"为所有已存在的工具接入。该命令不写入桌面聊天应用的配置（``claude_desktop_config.json``）、VS Code "
"的配置以及项目配置。"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:428
msgid ""
"``anet agents`` shows ``wired, up to date``, but the tools address "
"another node"
msgstr "``anet agents`` 显示 ``wired, up to date``，但工具连到的是另一个节点"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:432
msgid "``wire`` prints ``conflict`` and exits with status 1"
msgstr "``wire`` 输出 ``conflict`` 并以状态码 1 退出"

#: ../../agents/claude-code.rst:477
msgid ""
"The command removes the entry that ANet wrote and the skill file, and "
"makes a backup. An entry named ``anet`` that ANet did not write is not "
"touched. A tool that is not wired is reported as ``not wired``."
msgstr ""
"该命令移除 ANet 所写的条目与技能文件，并生成备份。名为 ``anet`` 但非 ANet 所写的条目不受影响。未接入的工具报告为 ``not"
" wired``。"

